   └─ Double-click index.html or visit http://localhost:8000

2. REGISTER PARTICIPANTS
   └─ Dashboard → "➕ Register Participant"
      • Enter: Name, Email
      • Select: Skills (at least 1)
      • Click: Register

3. RUN CLUSTERING
   └─ Dashboard → "🔄 Run Clustering"
      • Set: Team Size (default: 4)
      • Set: Event ID (default: 1)
      • Click: Run Clustering
      • Wait for: Algorithm to complete

4. VIEW TEAMS
   └─ Click "Teams" tab
      • See auto-generated teams
      • Verify skill balance
      • Check member composition

5. FINALIZE
   └─ Teams tab → [🔒 Lock] button
      • Lock teams when satisfied
      • Prevents accidental changes
      • Status updates to "Locked"

6. EXPORT
   └─ Dashboard → "📥 Export..." buttons
      • Download Participants CSV
      • Download Teams CSV
      • Open in Excel for reporting

