🐛 TROUBLESHOOTING
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Issue: Page is blank
  → Try different browser (Chrome, Firefox, Edge)
  → Press F12 to see console for errors

Issue: Modals not opening
  → Refresh page (Ctrl+F5)
  → Clear browser cache
  → Try incognito window

Issue: Data not saving
  → This is normal - data stored in memory only
  → Export before closing to save permanently

Issue: Export not working
  → Check browser download settings
  → Try different browser
  → Check file permissions

Issue: Can't access http://localhost
  → Make sure server is running (python -m http.server)
  → Try different port: python -m http.server 9000

